  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the Transformation of Harmful Gender Norms and Addressing Sexual and Reproductive Health to Prevent Gender-Based Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce gender-based violence among Bolivian adolescents and youth in selected regions through the delivery of innovative interventions centered on comprehensive sex education (CSE) and the transformation of harmful gender norms.</narrative>
